WEBVTT

00:07:31.758 --> 00:07:33.281
(Music ends)

00:07:33.305 --> 00:07:35.456
Okay, for the last piece I'd like to do,

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.906
this one goes very similar to this.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.331
I hope you guys recognize it.

00:07:39.355 --> 00:07:40.370
Here we go.

00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:47.772
Okay, that still works. Okay, good.

00:07:47.796 --> 00:07:48.850
All right, here we go.

00:07:48.874 --> 00:07:50.836
(Laughter)

00:07:52.306 --> 00:07:54.992
(Beatbox)